  "description": "Lean .NET local file logging library with the simplest possible static API — one line LOG.Info_Log(\"...\") and you're done, no DI, no LoggerFactory. HFT-grade async pipeline: ConcurrentQueue<struct LogItem> + persistent FileStream pool + 1ms cached timestamp + drop-oldest backpressure. Zero NuGet dependencies on net8.0 / net9.0 / net10.0. Designed for high-throughput multi-threaded scenarios like cryptocurrency tick streams. NOT related to NLog (jkowalski's package); the previous version \"Ozakboy.NLOG\" has been deprecated and renamed to OzaLog in v3.0. See https://github.com/ozakboy/OzaLog/blob/main/docs/en/migration.md for upgrade guide.",
